1 0 0 1 48 716 Tm (Educational use only. Not legal advice. Verify against your CC&Rs and state law.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 703 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 48 690 Tm (== VISUAL SUMMARY ==) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 677 Tm (Five takeaways to remember about the full path from notice to written decision. Use them as) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 664 Tm (a one-page briefing before you write or speak.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 651 Tm (* Start with procedure: Map notice, cure, hearing, and decision duties before debating the aesthetics of the full path from notice to written decision.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 638 Tm (* Make the decision point explicit: Your appeal should answer which appeal stage you are in now with exhibits, not adjectives.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 625 Tm (* Compare options deliberately: Know whether you are closer to Informal dispute, Formal hearing, or Post-hearing escalation before you escalate.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 612 Tm (* Write one remedy sentence: Boards skim-state waive, reduce, re-notice, or reverse in a single line tied to the full path from notice to written decision.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 599 Tm (* Keep escalation proportionate: Match collections risk and dollar amount to mediation, counsel, or court only after the packet is complete.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 586 Tm () Tj
