1 0 0 1 48 560 Tm (1. Capture the trigger) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 547 Tm (Save the notice, portal message, invoice, or verbal summary that started the dispute about) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 534 Tm (the full path from notice to written decision. Note the date received.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 521 Tm (2. Pull controlling text) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 508 Tm (Locate the statute, CC&R, rule, and fine-schedule language that supposedly authorizes action) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 495 Tm (on the full path from notice to written decision.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 482 Tm (3. Build the evidence spine) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 469 Tm (Assemble dated photos, correspondence, ledgers, and comparables that speak directly to which) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 456 Tm (appeal stage you are in now.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 443 Tm (4. Choose the procedural path) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 430 Tm (Pick cure, informal dispute, formal hearing, payment under protest, ADR, or counsel based on) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 417 Tm (deadlines and stakes around the full path from notice to written decision.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 404 Tm (5. Submit a written ask) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 391 Tm (Send one clear remedy request \(waive, reduce, re-notice, or reverse\) tied to which appeal) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 378 Tm (stage you are in now, with exhibits attached.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48 365 Tm (6. Confirm the outcome in writing) Tj
